      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wac ma kwo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I cakirok, wac oyido nitie; go oyido nitie gi Were, aka wac no oyido obedo Were won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i cakirok go oyido nitie gi Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gi go Were ocweyo gimoro je manitie, ongoye gima nitie ma go ama k'ocweyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimoro je manitie olimo kwo i go aka kwo no oyido a lero pa ji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lero no liel i mudho aka mudho kinyal neko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.1.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 1:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.3.1+LUK.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 3:1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhano moro obino, ma Were ooro, nyinge Yohana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go obino paka jamikwenda ma luwo ri lero no, ŋey ji je jowoyey luwo i go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go am'oyido k'obedo lero no, to jamikwenda ma luwo ri lero ayin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lero mar'adieri ma miyo ji je lero, won am'onwaŋo labino i piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go obedo i piny, ma cakirok mere owok bonge, to piny k'oŋeyo go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go obino i piny pere won, to ji pere jok'ojolo go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jono je ma jojolo go ma joyeyo i nyinge, omiyo jo meni ma lokirok nyithindho pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nywolirok pa jono k'obedo ma remo pa dhano, kosa ro mito pa ji, kosa mito pa dhano, to ro mito pa Were won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wac olokere Dhano, aka obedo gi wan, to waneno dwoŋ pere paka Wod Were acel kende, m'owok bongi Were Bawan, m'opoŋ gi nema kodi adieri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohana obedo paka jamikwenda pere m'okoko ka waco ni, “Me a ŋat'atieko luwo kwoŋe ni, ‘Ŋata luwan cen loyan swa gi dwoŋ, rupiri go otelo bedo ran.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adieri, wajoje watieko nwaŋo nema wi nema kwoŋ ŋaŋo pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Cik obino luwo i cingi Musa, to nema kodi adieri obino riwan luwo bongi Yesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongoye moro m'otieko neno Were, kwanyo woko Wode won m'orikere ruŋeti Bamere am'onyutho wan go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mikwenda pa Yohana Jakibatisa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a gima Yohana owaco munyo Joyuda ma Yerusalem jooro jocway ri Were i wi migam kanyacel gi Jolevi penjo go ni, “To in iŋa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohana k'okwero dwoko, to waco kamaler ni, “Aŋat'akibedo Kristo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAL.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 3:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.15+DEU.18.16+DEU.18.17+DEU.18.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 18:15-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jopenjo go ni, “To in iŋa won? In Elia?” Go odwoko ni, “Akibedo go.” Jopenjo go kendo ni, “Ibedo jatuci wac Were?” Ana go ni, “Be!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jowaco ni, “Ere waci riwan ŋat'ibedo to. Waripo dwoko wac ri joma jooro wan. Iwaco aŋo ma mako kwoŋin iwon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.40.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 40:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana Yohana ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jofarisayo ama jodhiro jomikwenda no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jopenjo Yohana ni, “K'ikibedo Kristo kosa Elia kosa jatuci wac Were, to raŋo m'ibatisa ji?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohana odwoko ni, “An abatisa kodi pi; to i dier win ka ocungo ŋata wikuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go luwo ŋeyan, aka akiripi kada gonyo thol war pere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gigipiny me je otimere i Bethania loka ma jwom Yordan kama go oyido batisa iye ji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawere mere Yohana oneno Yesu munyo bino bonge to waco ni, “Neni Nyathi rombo pa Were ma kwanyo woko gimarac ma piny! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a ŋat'oyido aluwo kwoŋe munyo awaco ni, ‘Moro luwo ŋeyan, aka loyan gi dwoŋ rupiri go ama otelo bedo ran.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An won oyido akuya go, t'abino timo tic ma kibatisa ji kodi pi ŋey go wonenere kamaler ri Joisiraili.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a mikwenda ma Yohana omiyo, “Aneno Cuny Maleŋ oloro wok i polo to pie kwoŋe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An oyido akuya go, to Were m'ooran kibatisa ji kodi pi am'owaco ran ni, ‘Ŋat'inonen Cuny Maleŋ loro piny to pie kwoŋe, meno a ŋata ripo kibatisa ji gi Cuny Maleŋ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atieko neno gi tito ri ji ni ŋati me won a Wod Were.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jofonjirok pa Yesu marapena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawere mere Yohana onwaŋo ocungo kenyo kodi jofonjirok pere ario; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka munyo oneno Yesu wotho, owaco ni, “Neni Nyathi rombo pa Were!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jofonjirok ario no jowinjo munyo go waco ameno to joluwo Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu owire to neno jono munyo joluwo go, to penjo jo ni, “Wiyenyo aŋo?” Jodwoko ni, “Rabi, ibedo kune?” (Rabi, nyaka ni jafonji). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go odwoko ni, “Biye neni win.” Gikenyo jokidho gine to joneno kama go bed'iye, to jocowo ndelo no bonge (ato onwaŋo obedo kapa sawa apar m'othieno).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acel kwoŋ j'ario ma jowinjo gima Yohana owaco, to joluwo Yesu, obedo Andereya, omin Simon Petero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Andereya onwaŋo Simon, omin go, to waco rigo ni, “Wanwaŋo Mesiya.” (Wac me dwoŋ mere ni Kristo). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo go okelo Simon bongi Yesu. Yesu oneno go to waco ni, “Kere ilwoŋin ni Simon, wod pa Yona? Pama nyingin bino bedo Kefas.” (Kefas me rom gi Petero, aka dwoŋ mere ni, “Tele.”)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu lwoŋo Filipo gi Nathanel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawere mere Yesu otimo can ma kidho Galili, to nwaŋo Filipo to waco rigo ni, “Luwan!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Filipo onwaŋo wok Bethsayida, tindi ma Andereya kodi Petero bende onwaŋo jowok'iye.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Filipo onwaŋo Nathanel to waco rigo ni, “Watieko nwaŋo ŋata Musa ondiko kwoŋe i kitawo ma Cik, kodi ŋata jotuci wac Were jondiko kwoŋe. Go obedo Yesu, wod Yozefu ma Nazareth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Nathanel penjo ni, “Bende nitie gimaber manyalo wok Nazareth?” Filipo odwoko ni, “Ere biye neni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yesu oneno Nathanel, oluwo kwoŋe ni, “Me Jaisiraili mar'adieri; ongoye komo moro kwoŋe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nathanel openjo go ni, “Iŋeyan nedi?” Ana Yesu, “Anenin munyo ibedo i tiendi makuyu, mafodi Filipo k'obino lwoŋin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nathanel odwoko ni, “Jafonji, ibedo Wod Were! In a Kere pa Joisiraili!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu owaco ni, “Iyeyo nyaka rupiri awaco rin nike anenin munyo ibedo i tiendi makuyu? Ibino neno gigipiny madongo maloyo me!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Yesu owaco rigo ni, “Adieri awaco rin, ibino neno munyo polo oyawere kareno jomalaika pa Were joidho malo aka joloro piny wi Wod Dhano.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.1.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
